{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62233748f33d54bfef5d4151e992668872ef33afebdfd3fc72087e778bd1e3ed", "ja": "（今日はまつりのPV撮影！　今は休憩時間だけど、\nまつりの姿がないな……どこだ？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄まつり的PV！现在是休息时间，可是没看到まつり……她去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "f75139547a01d63bdc8078858108b33ff0e0e3d6fb1588405af644a120ca8340", "ja": "……。\nはいほ～～～～～～～っ☆", "zh": "……。\n嗨吼～～～～～～～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8952914a39065efaab5189fd71c9e500f44e7a534378aaff7edd6d48382c6fd4", "ja": "うわっ！？", "zh": "哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "e19cb0777f678f3254efe42bc1bb0719900caf4143faf111305ce591eb62cfe8", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}さん、\nビックリしたのです？　作戦、大成功なのです！", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生，\n吓了一跳吗？作战大成功哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c6ddb668d2c86c9b37e54241ee241921c186d05578579d71b831f3cd2db83064", "ja": "あ、ああ、ビックリしたよ……。\nどこにいたんだ？", "zh": "啊、啊啊，确实吓了一跳……  \n你刚才藏在哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "478f59072e55d29f4af64edd3f3b4406390f8dfac0338126220a48a14e67f7f3", "ja": "{$P$}さんに気づかれないように、\n息をひそめていたのです。", "zh": "为了不让{$P$}先生发现，\n茉莉一直屏住呼吸藏着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "9fbaa3a8df4cb14c3495f112bcd92c8680cef7f4ebc188a49e3fe3047ad95608", "ja": "今日のまつりは、妖怪の姫ですから。\nみんなを驚かせるのも、大事なお仕事なのですよ♪", "zh": "今天的公主可是妖怪公主。\n吓大家一跳也是很重要的工作哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d884076fdb0d87e5c9b125e7c459cf4b17e3168415a424e9b97ae64146145c57", "ja": "なるほど……。\nすっかりキョンシーになりきってるみたいだな。", "zh": "原来如此……  \n看来你已经完全进入僵尸的角色了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "98a2c1ee5da99599982a0ac0ff989cda2577a06fb009981e3c590b179154c6d8", "ja": "はいなのです！　ぴょんぴょんジャンプして歩くの、\nとってもかわいくて、お気に入りなのです♪", "zh": "是的！像这样蹦蹦跳跳地走路，\n特别可爱，我最喜欢了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "1d2e7f4deccc9fdf92fcc57439f29cbf957c51e83a299f125a2bc0e17cd23617", "ja": "でも……そう思ってくれない子も\nいるみたいなのです。しょんぼりなのです……。", "zh": "不过……好像也有不这么想的孩子。人家有点失落……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e456d4313a8b19edca6eec57b67c271e61399081d3855d95643f6237f7841299", "ja": "ん？　何かあったのか？", "zh": "嗯？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "64fa5491118b9fa7bdc316f1efba3104093a9e58ac79aa1f71d327b2dbe38280", "ja": "さっき撮影したシーンで、\n子役の子を怖がらせてしまったみたいなのです。", "zh": "刚才拍摄的场景里，好像把那个小演员吓到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "1fa90139652acda52eb8cfc135a8e0ae86acfddcd336e124b9613928a3d6d909", "ja": "まつりはこのキョンシー姿、\nとってもきゅーと！だと思うのですけど……。", "zh": "茉莉觉得这身僵尸打扮，\n明明就超级可爱呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5120c091bc0b8a5c9c0098627dfcf1b174bf9b65c3b81fccbf32e27248c35810", "ja": "結構、動きが独特だからな……。\n子どもから見ると、少し怖いのかも。", "zh": "动作还挺特别的……从孩子的角度来看，可能会觉得有点可怕吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "910d097c5d392f94e239935731060affb89ba4f3f9c7eb0d1ce283d28d6e69e3", "ja": "まつりはその子にも、かわいいって思って\nもらえるような、キョンシーさんを目指したいのです。", "zh": "茉莉想以成为能让那个孩子也觉得\n可爱的僵尸先生为目标呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "a2b08390882528ebc279ee88230f0ed488e037285071f38f6d1cd3a80a25295c", "ja": "だから、それを次の作戦にするのです！　題して、\nキョンシーさんの好感度アップ作戦☆　なのです！", "zh": "所以，就把这个定为下一个作战计划吧！名为——\n提升僵尸小姐好感度作战☆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2a05afc54b22693513422e2a142726915ddc687f444e15558c561f764d6ba5d0", "ja": "驚かせつつ、好かれたいって事か？\nうーん……なかなか難しそうだな、それは。", "zh": "也就是说，想吓到别人，同时又想让人喜欢你吗？\n嗯……这可相当困难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "ddaf7422daec7302735069d73cdf714fad63174a83ff058a0241099c70aaa14f", "ja": "でも、まつりが楽しそうにしている姿を見せれば、\nきっと印象も変わると思うのです。", "zh": "不过，只要让大家看到小公主开心的样子，我想印象一定也会有所改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "91e09eb786eba25842303860ca5806e2afb002ddef09a569ce118830b327107b", "ja": "だから姫は、今日の撮影をたくさん楽しむのです！\nそうすれば子どもたちも、楽しいと思うのです……ね？", "zh": "所以，公主今天要尽情享受拍摄才行！这样一来，孩子们也会觉得开心……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1019_p", "source_sha256": "36142add3bf9f022ce5c67fc7e4ff62b4fa3fcd6c6e76ce8c8d3cc0b921cd654", "ja": "そうだな、よろしく頼むよ。\n……ああ、それと、お菓子でも用意しておこうか。", "zh": "是啊，那就拜托你了。\n……对了，要不要准备些点心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c558eed13a5603c4ea86ab3decd776a69629dcae02db38ef874a59162f1d96d5", "ja": "子どもたちに、持って行ったらいいんじゃないか？\nトリックオアトリート、的な。", "zh": "带去给孩子们不是挺好的吗？\n就像是“不给糖就捣蛋”那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "f4093fb5e794d362878d0ac47cf6b26f36887b5709f659538d8a08834dbdb1a7", "ja": "はいほー！　ナイスアイディアなのです。\n撮影の後に、差し入れしましょー！", "zh": "嘿哟！真是个好主意哦。\n拍摄结束后，就给孩子们送点慰问品吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "f651fcbaa645a159a99d1da4c1f48f2cb5b132adfbd5ce49535babdaeb8209ba", "ja": "ありがとうなのです、{$P$}さん♪\nそれでは、らぶりー！に頑張ってくるのです！", "zh": "谢谢你哦，{$P$}先生♪\n那么，祭会可爱！又努力地去表现的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0294_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4c474728c0ffea4b8c0c892a7ba231002250bc9a52a8bfa6d3db9962987c1952", "ja": "（その後の撮影は、まつりと子ども達の\n楽しそうな笑顔で溢れていた。作戦、大成功だな！）", "zh": "（之后的拍摄现场，充满了小祭和孩子们开心的笑容。这个作战，大成功啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
